<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Where to buy page</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="container">
        <%= require('./partials/header.html') %>



        <!-- <img id="purchase-hero" src="images/ace-ball-boards.jpg" alt="Ace ball boards" height="5712px" width="4284px"> -->
<!-- add local delivery options -->
        <div class="purchase-form-container">
            
            <div id="purchase-page-container">
                <h1>Products</h1>
                <!-- ace ball classic -->
                 <!-- title, desc, image, buy button -->
                <div>
                    <h2>Ace Ball Classic</h2>
                    <p>Classic Boards. The original Ace Ball look. Clean, timeless, and built to play. Our Classic Boards showcase the natural wood grain with the signature Ace Ball logo and playing-card details. Choose between black or white accents, complete with matching nets for a clean, classic finish.</p>
                    <img src="images/ace-ball-classic.jpg" alt="">
                    <div>
                        <!-- <p>$199</p> -->
                        <button class="buy-btn" data-price-id="price_1UEHFoF8hi3d5Sha1f9yFk8Q">Buy Now</button>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- ace ball signature -->
                 <div>
                    <h2>Ace Ball signature</h2>
                    <p>The Signature Series takes Ace Ball up a notch with a sleek black or white finish, contrasting Ace Ball graphics, and signature playing-card details. A premium look that stands out without going full team colors.</p>
                    <img src="images/ace-ball-sig.jpg" alt="">
                    <button class="buy-btn" data-price-id="price_1UEI32F8hi3d5ShaS7UVk6tx">Buy Now</button>
                 </div>



                <!-- ace ball teams(OSU, Browns, Steelers) -->
                 <div>
                    <h2>Ace Ball Teams</h2>
                    <p>Rep your colors. Play Ace Ball. Bring game-day energy anywhere with our Team Series Ace Ball boards. Each set features bold, team-inspired color combinations and striping, finished with the Ace Ball logo for a clean, unmistakable look. Perfect for tailgates, watch parties, backyard games, and anyone who wants to represent their colors.</p>

                    <h3>OSU</h3>
                    <img src="images/ace-ball-osu.jpg" alt="">
                    <button class="buy-btn" data-price-id="price_1UEI6wF8hi3d5Shaz2Xx4IKb">Buy Now</button>

                    <h3>Browns</h3>
                    <img src="images/ace-ball-browns.jpg" alt="">
                    <button class="buy-btn" data-price-id="price_1UEvK4F8hi3d5ShaWmceY37b">Buy Now</button>

                    <h3>Steelers</h3>
                    <img src="images/ace-ball-steelers.jpg" alt="">
                    <button class="buy-btn" data-price-id="price_1UEvKiF8hi3d5ShanM7orjAb">Buy Now</button>
                 </div>


            </div>
        </div>
        <dialog id="checkout-modal">
            <div style="text-align: right; padding: 1rem;">
                <button id="close-modal-btn">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div id="checkout"></div>
        </dialog>

        <script src="https://js.stripe.com/v3/"></script>

            <%= require('./partials/footer.html') %>

    </div>
</body>
</html>